{"id":"vod_bf_29667","vodId":"29667","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"少年同盟第一季","name_cn":"少年同盟第一季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-30/0ab210d3d00057bffeed62540429aad6.jpg"},"summary":"故事围绕着五位少年的校园生活展开，双胞胎兄弟浅羽悠太和佑希，和他们的青梅竹马——冢原要和松冈春，以及转校生橘千鹤。一个个清新淡雅的画面，描绘了五位少年一段段幽默温馨的青春故事。　　在漫天樱花飞舞中，穗稀高中的学生迎来了开学典礼。四名少年曾经在春天相遇，之后便共同度过了许多个春天，今年的他们成为了穗稀高中的二年级生。新学年的开始，冢原要强迫佑希参加学校的社团，运动神经很发达的佑希却情愿躲在家里看漫画……不久后，个性活泼外向的混血儿橘千鹤转到他们班上，原来他曾经是佑希的童年玩伴。自此，五人开始了属于他们的简简单单但又真真实实的青春生活。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 07:06:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdiy